WEBVTT

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:30.573
As the world has gone into lockdown,

00:03:30.597 --> 00:03:33.926
many of us have experienced the challenges
of working from home.

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:36.546
But some jobs are hard to do remotely.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.669
If you work in health care
or public safety,

00:03:38.693 --> 00:03:40.816
you need to be on the front lines.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.793
If you're in manufacturing,
production or distribution,

00:03:43.817 --> 00:03:47.446
you have to be on-site at a
farm, factory or warehouse.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:51.024
We're all depending on the people
who are risking their health and safety

00:03:51.048 --> 00:03:52.464
to go to work.

00:03:52.488 --> 00:03:54.597
Yet, in the knowledge
and service industries,

00:03:54.621 --> 00:03:57.316
many jobs can be done with online tools.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.505
And that's not as new as it seems.